 "coverageLimits": [
  "Military-only aerodromes and heliports are not in AIP AD 1.3/AD 2 coordinates and are not mapped.",
  "The 120 m AGL and crowded/border restricted areas of Art. 4 are not geographic here.",
  "Temporary MND prohibitions (Art. 3(6)), NOTAMs and the 500 m / 200 m margins of other sites are not tracked."
 ],
